      "date": "2026-05-03T18:08:16.000Z",
      "title": "SHREECEM: Upcoming Board Actions And Subsidiary Plan Will Support Undervalued Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on Shree Cement from ₹28,479.03 to ₹27,727.85 after applying a slightly higher discount rate and assuming a lower profit margin, partly offset by updated expectations for revenue growth and future P/E. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled on May 6, 2026 to review audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and year ending March 31, 2026, and to consider recommending a final dividend for FY 2025-26 on the equity shares, if any (company filing).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/materials/nse-shreecem/shree-cement-shares/eigmakf2-shreecem-upcoming-board-meeting-and-dividend-to-influence-future-performance/updates/17-analysts-have-trimmed-their-price-target-on-shree-cement-fro",
      "raw_subtype": "narrative-update"
    },
    {
      "id": "c854d574-6b71-4d14-b410-97032fa65d60",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-04-19T06:08:20.000Z",
